@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Implementation Notes";
}

<section class="portal-card">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Implementation notes</div>
    <h1 class="h2 mb-3">Configured customer journey</h1>
    <p>This MVC implementation now follows the real customer flow: send OTP through the SMS API, verify the customer session, load the CRM customer profile, retrieve the BRM authorization token, query the BRM dashboard inventory, and resolve each service instance back through CRM to show the line MSISDN values.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">The AD domain for CAM access is configured as <strong>amc.al</strong>. Sensitive credentials such as access keys and passwords are intentionally left external to source control and should be supplied through secure configuration providers.</p>
</section>
